WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:31.547
The king called Tom to the Throne Room.

2
00:00:31.548 --> 00:00:37.386
"Princess Mary has disappeared!" the king cried.

3
00:00:37.387 --> 00:00:41.362
"I'll find the princess!" Tom said.

4
00:00:41.363 --> 00:00:44.575
He waved his wand. Poof!

5
00:00:44.576 --> 00:00:46.749
There was a puff of smoke.

6
00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:50.073
But nothing else happened.

7
00:00:50.074 --> 00:00:52.321
"Oops," Tom said.

8
00:00:52.322 --> 00:00:57.379
"Wait . . ." Cat sniffed the smoke.

9
00:00:57.380 --> 00:01:00.909
"It smells like trees and moss," she said.

10
00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:03.804
"It smells like the Dark Forest!"

11
00:01:03.805 --> 00:01:07.518
Tom gasped and looked at the king.

12
00:01:07.519 --> 00:01:12.065
"Princess Mary is in the Dark Forest!" Tom said.

13
00:01:12.066 --> 00:01:16.710
"What?" The king turned pale.

14
00:01:16.711 --> 00:01:20.795
"The Dark Forest is dangerous!" he cried.

15
00:01:20.796 --> 00:01:23.817
"We must find the princess at once!"

16
00:01:23.818 --> 00:01:30.464
The king called his knights and guards.

17
00:01:30.465 --> 00:01:33.694
"Search the Dark Forest now!" he said.

18
00:01:33.695 --> 00:01:43.354
"Find Princess Mary!"

19
00:01:43.355 --> 00:01:51.484
The knights and guards crashed through the Dark Forest.

20
00:01:51.485 --> 00:01:57.913
They called loudly for the princess.

21
00:01:57.914 --> 00:02:04.478
But they couldn't find her anywhere.

22
00:02:04.479 --> 00:02:13.248
Finally they returned to the castle.

23
00:02:13.249 --> 00:02:15.690
"Wizard!" the king yelled.

24
00:02:15.691 --> 00:02:18.595
"You must find the princess!"

25
00:02:18.596 --> 00:02:20.948
Tom gulped.

26
00:02:20.949 --> 00:02:31.959
"Yes, Your Majesty."

27
00:02:31.960 --> 00:02:37.271
"I used to live in the Dark Forest," Cat said.

28
00:02:37.272 --> 00:02:39.389
"Follow me."

29
00:02:39.390 --> 00:02:43.129
Tom followed Cat into the Dark Forest.

30
00:02:43.130 --> 00:02:46.971
They looked all around.

31
00:02:46.972 --> 00:02:55.334
"There!" Cat said suddenly.

32
00:02:55.335 --> 00:02:58.351
Tom saw footprints on the ground.

33
00:02:58.352 --> 00:03:03.157
He saw some hoofprints too.

34
00:03:03.158 --> 00:03:12.319
"Princess Mary is with the unicorn!" Cat said.
